WEBVTT

00:00:00.129 --> 00:00:00.907
I never got

00:00:00.907 --> 00:00:01.943
around to making

00:00:01.943 --> 00:00:03.079
a portfolio.

00:00:03.079 --> 00:00:06.073
I kept procrastinating.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.167
2,000 CVs. One role.

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:10.733
I didn’t send mine

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:12.967
I folded it into a plane,

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:14.533
crumpled it,

00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:16.033
shredded it,

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.433
and burned it

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:20.633
onto a CD

00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:22.633
for a 1999 iMac

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:25.633
Dialing in

00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:27.333
Find your face to log in

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:29.767
A ’99 desktop to explore

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:31.233
Folders of real projects

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.333
Games, like Samosa Snake

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:35.967
A podcast you control

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.767
Off the CV, episode one

00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:41.333
Built by voice, with Wispr Flow and Claude.

00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:41.333
So I sent this instead.

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:44.733
Open it on a laptop, sound on

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:44.733
sameep.ai

